# Implementation of a Regional Program of Educational Administration.

**Authors:** Repin, S. A., Serikov, G. N.

## Abstract
Describes the development and implementation of an educational administrative program in the Cheliabinsk Oblast region of post-Soviet Russia. The system attempted to assign appropriate responsibilities at the local level while maintaining a unified national system of education. Briefly discusses other problems concerning educational support and financing. (MJP)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ556245

